===Adjective===
{{en-adj|more,er}}

# Causing [[boredom]] or [[tiredness]]; making one feel tired and [[impatient]].
#: {{ux|en|What a '''boring''' film that was! I almost fell asleep.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1983|author=w:Peter De Vries|chapter=13|title=Slouching Towards Kalamazoo|location=Boston, Mass.|publisher=w:Little, Brown and Company|page=212|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/slouchingtowards00devr/page/212/mode/1up|isbn=0-316-18172-2|passage=Oh, let's not spoil a good dinner with a reconcilation{{sic}} scene. We’ve hardly split up. We’ll get to be like two old people who can communicate, and nothing’s '''boringer''' than that.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2004|author=w:Nancy Rue|chapter=Sophie and the Scoundrels (Book 3)|title=Sophie’s Secret|series=Faithgirlz!; The Sophie Series, 2|location=Grand Rapids, Mich.|publisher=[[w:Zondervan|Zonderkidz]]|pages=125–126|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/sophiessecret0000ruen/page/126/mode/1up|isbn=0-310-70757-9|passage=“I had the most boring day in life yesterday. I couldn’t go to work with my dad, so I went with my mom.” {{...}} “Mine was even '''boringer''' than yours,” Kitty said. She was starting to whine, and she flipped her ponytail. She did both of those things a lot. “I didn’t get to spend that much time with my dad, either, since he’s a pilot.”}}
#* {{RQ:Guardian|author=Arwa Mahdawi|title=Self-hypnosis, amphetamines? I tried eight hacks in my quest to be more productive|date=2019-08-05|url=https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2019/aug/05/eight-hacks-my-quest-to-be-more-productive|passage=It made me feel a little nauseous but was great for powering through '''boring''' tasks. It did not, however, do anything for my creativity or improve my thinking in any way.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20190830153626/https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2019/aug/05/eight-hacks-my-quest-to-be-more-productive}}
# {{lb|en|chiefly|_|Manglish}} Suffering from [[boredom]]; mildly annoyed and restless through having [[nothing]] to [[do]].
#: {{synonyms|en|bored}}
#: {{uxi|en|I very '''boring'''.|I am very '''bored'''.}}
# Used, designed to be used, or able to drill holes.
#: {{co|en|'''boring''' equipment}}
#: {{co|en|'''boring''' snails}}
# Capable of [[penetrating]]; [[piercing]].

